lass=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Tomb\">Haunted Tomb</a> west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Buried%20Cathedral\">Buried Cathedral</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFights in close combat and some times uses several spells at once.<br/><br/>A burster spectre attacks in melee range. A burster spectre never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt may use all its spells in the same turn dealing a high combo that can hit even those not directly close to it. Avoid using <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a> at all costs since it will <a href=\"#/wiki/Damage%20Reflection\">reflect</a> it back to you 66% stronger.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch reduced the drop rate of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> for this creature, thus changing its rarity from \"semi-rare\" to \"very rare\".</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>D